  "bodyHash": "9e93dc58df7cd25f",
  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">此專案已 abandoned 期待在新的專案中與你再次相遇</span></strong></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\">如果有興趣參與開發，請查看 GitHub 上的原始碼連結</span><br>歡迎來到 Aviator Dreams</strong></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a533c351-0cb6-4108-b861-37c76661ef62.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"414\" height=\"380\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:40px\"><strong>什麼是 Aviator Dreams：這是針對一個名為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-aircraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Aircraft</a> 的擴充套件，該模組為遊戲增加了從小型雙翼飛機到大型飛船等多種飛機，而 Aviator Dreams 則會為該模組添加更多飛機。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:40px\"><strong>主題：Aviator Dreams 旨在為遊戲中添加現實生活中的飛機，我們不從事幻想類內容，因為我們在這方面並不擅長。目前的主題是 Pioneer，主要是一些早期的螺旋槳飛機。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><strong>已包含的飛機（目前）：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:80px\"><strong>-Douglas DC-1</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1014/248/2024-11-14_21.png\" alt=\"截圖圖像\" width=\"575\" height=\"306\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -Douglas DC-2</strong></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1014/247/2024-11-14_21.png\" alt=\"截圖圖像\" width=\"580\" height=\"307\"></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -Douglas C-47</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1014/246/2024-11-14_21.png\" alt=\"截圖圖像\" width=\"583\" height=\"305\"></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -DeHavilland Comet 1</strong></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1014/241/2024-11-14_21.png\" alt=\"截圖圖像\" width=\"587\" height=\"294\"></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -Fokker F.VIIA</strong></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1014/245/2024-11-14_21.png\" alt=\"截圖圖像\" width=\"587\" height=\"308\"></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -Fokker F.VIIB/3M</strong></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1014/244/2024-11-14_21.png\" alt=\"截圖圖像\" width=\"592\" height=\"278\"></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -Lockheed L-1049G Super Constellation</strong></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1014/249/2024-11-14_21.png\" alt=\"截圖圖像\" width=\"598\" height=\"316\"></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -Totoya Stout K100(非飛機)</strong></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1014/243/2024-11-14_21.png\" alt=\"截圖圖像\" width=\"603\" height=\"313\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><strong>未來計劃：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"padding-left:80px\"><strong>-Douglas DC-3</strong></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:80px\"><strong>-Douglas DC-4</strong></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:80px\"><strong>-Hawker Siddley Trident 3B</strong></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:80px\"><strong>-DeHavilland DH.16</strong></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:80px\"><strong>-Boeing 737-200</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -以及如果我決定添加的其他飛機</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><strong>貢獻者：Nax（模型和紋理）。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Hashim（Fokker F7 紋理）<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Bomb787（Forge 清理和註冊修復）</strong></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:80px\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 感謝 Conczin 幫助我設置項目並進行故障排除。<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 感謝 Immersive Aircraft 和 Man of Many Planes 的所有者提供了有用的源代碼以方便擴充套件開發</strong></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
